          "name": "Day-ahead prices by delivery area",
          "request": {
            "name": "Day-ahead prices by delivery area",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns day-ahead auction prices for one or more delivery areas on a given CET delivery date, in 15-minute Market Time Unit entries plus per-area block-average aggregates and daily statistics. Verified live (HTTP 200 with price data) on 2026-07-11.",
